abstract: "Explicit independent sets in strong powers of C11 give R6 lower bounds 5.295498536418623 in dimension 186, 5.295510441529957 in dimension 198, and 5.295515544509239 in dimension 213. Each constructed root strictly improves its matching R5 root and the four older frozen comparison roots. AI co-developed with OpenAI's Astra 6 Pro and Codex GPT-6 Astra Extra-High. The finite constructions are Lean checked with disclosed native-evaluation trust; the general avoidance-profile calculus remains a written proof."
